Subject: [#94-11-483] GENE: Resurrecting the dodo?

Another problem with genetic resurrection is that you will have a
genetic bottleneck (all the species descended from a few individuals)
unless you have DNA from a large sample (say, 1000) of organisms.
A population created from the DNA of just a few dozen ancestors would
be susceptible to disease.

